<SAMI>
<HEAD>
<TITLE>Sync Gaps SAMI Subtitle</TITLE>
<STYLE TYPE="text/css">
<!--
P { font-family: Arial; font-size: 14pt; color: white; background-color: black; text-align: center; }
.ENUSCC { Name: English; lang: en-US; SAMIType: CC; }
-->
</STYLE>
</HEAD>
<BODY>

<SYNC Start=0>
<P Class=ENUSCC>The first subtitle appears immediately.</P>

<SYNC Start=3000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>&nbsp;</P>

<SYNC Start=15000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>After a 12-second gap, subtitles resume here.</P>

<SYNC Start=18000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>&nbsp;</P>

<SYNC Start=35000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Another long gap — 17 seconds of silence.</P>

<SYNC Start=38000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>Short gap before the next one.</P>

<SYNC Start=40000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>&nbsp;</P>

<SYNC Start=60000>
<P Class=ENUSCC>A 20-second gap before this final subtitle.</P>

</BODY>
</SAMI>
